  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incidence using alternating HfO2 and SiO2 layers. Layer sequence: HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2|HfO2|SiO2 (24 finite layers, starting with HfO2 on substrate, ending with SiO2 at air interface). Initialize thicknesses at [123, 90, 122, 90, 136, 168, 98, 157, 116, 140, 111, 91, 153, 90, 118, 140, 129, 90, 119, 155, 112, 90, 121, 117] nm from iteration 09 best candidate. Apply gradient_thickness optimizer with bounds ±20nm around initialization. Evaluate over 300-450 nm and 1000-1700 nm wavelength bands at normal incidence. Maximize transmittance in 1000-1700 nm band and reflectance in 300-450 nm band simultaneously. Use coherent smatrix solver. Include ±5% relative uniform thickness tolerance robustness analysis. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 300-450 nm, 1000-1700 nm. soft objectives: high transmission in 1000-1700 nm; high reflection in 300-450 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: low transmission in 300-450 nm; low reflection in 1000-1700 nm. manufacturing constraints: total layer count <= 30; materials restricted to HfO2 and SiO2.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Optimize a 24-layer alternating HfO2/SiO2 dielectric coating on fused silica under air incidence at normal incidence. Initialize layer thicknesses from the provided vector and constrain allowable variations to ±20 nm. Simulate coherently from 300 to 1700 nm. Simultaneously maximize mean transmittance in the 1000–1700 nm band and mean reflectance in the 300–450 nm band. Evaluate design robustness under ±5% relative uniform thickness tolerance.",
